ldren":"What we do about it: we ask for a real export before quoting, not a description of one. If we quote without seeing it and it turns out worse, that is our risk and our cost, not a variation order."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-2xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[var(--tracking-wide)] text-ink-muted","children":"Our side to manage"}]]}]]}]]}]
